Perch Nest
https://github.com/perch-nest/perch-nest.github.io

Perch Nest brings together Perch, created by Just-Rice (https://github.com/Just-Rice/perch), and Roost, a Windows port
of Perch (https://github.com/faarisaahmed/roost). It is distributed under the same licence as both, the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The protocol, the security model and the relay that Perch Nest builds on were designed and written by Just-Rice for
Perch. The websites under /mac/ and /windows/ are built from the Perch and Roost repositories, unchanged, and keep their
own licences and notices.
